      "explanation": "Field-stage property-expression worker. It chooses the emission shape: private storage via accessPrivateIdentifier plus createPrivateInstanceFieldInitializer/createPrivateStaticFieldInitializer (lines 2751-2773, helpers at 3365-3385); assignment style (this.x = value) when useDefineForClassFields is false (emitAssignment, lines 2731 and 2811-2815) or for private identifiers; otherwise define style via Object.defineProperty with enumerable/configurable/writable/value descriptor (lines 2817-2832). For parameter properties it recovers the local value through original-node metadata: propertyOriginalNode := tx.EmitContext().MostOriginal(property.AsNode()) and ast.IsParameterPropertyDeclaration (lines 2785-2786), then explicitly unwraps the decorator-added '(__runInitializers(this, _instanceExtraInitializers), void 0)' wrapper, keeping the __runInitializers call and inlining the local name after it (lines 2790-2806) so decorator effects survive. A non-simple computed property name is replaced by NewGeneratedNameForNode(propertyName) (line 2743) so the once-evaluated cache value is reused."
